                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Today, the House will take up the Lower Health Care Premiums for All Americans Act \u2014 a critical first step toward fixing the broken health care system Democrats created.\n\nThis bill FINALLY delivers commonsense reforms to lower premiums, expand access, increase choice and flexibility, and bring transparency to health care. It would CUT premium costs by at least 11% and SAVE taxpayers nearly $30 billion.\n\nThat\u2019s REAL RELIEF for American families.",
